claimRewards
  ├── when the caller does not have REWARDS_OPERATOR_ROLE on the vault
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the to address is zero
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the configured reward token equals the vault's underlying asset
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when the configured reward token equals the Comet market itself
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when the caller has REWARDS_OPERATOR_ROLE on the vault
      ├── it should emit a RewardsClaimed event
      ├── it should call claimTo on the CometRewards contract
      └── it should send reward tokens already held by the adapter to the recipient
